flowchart TD
    Start([PR Created / Synchronized]) --> Pipeline[PR Orchestrator Pipeline\n.github/workflows/pr-pipeline.yml]
    Pipeline --> Autofix[Autofix job\neslint --fix / prettier --write\nstacked PR lint-remediation]
    Autofix -->|files fixed: relay squash-merges,\nthen the fixed commit is checked| Pipeline

    subgraph Parallel [All Gates in Parallel ~1-2m]
        Autofix --> Gate[Metadata\n.github/workflows/gate-metadata.yml]
        Autofix --> Lint[Lint\n.github/workflows/gate-lint.yml]
        Autofix --> Build[Build\n.github/workflows/gate-build.yml]
        Autofix --> Test[Tests & Coverage\n.github/workflows/gate-tests.yml]
        Autofix --> Sec[Security\n.github/workflows/gate-security.yml]
        Autofix --> DocEval[Docs Drift\n.github/workflows/gate-docs.yml]
    end

    %% Direct fix loop (no stacked PR)
    Gate -->|needs-metadata| AgentMeta[🤖 Fix: PR metadata\nUpdates title & description via API]

    %% Stacked PR remediation loops (auto-merged), dispatched at the same time
    Lint -->|lint-failed| AgentLint[🤖 Fix: Lint & format\nOpens Stacked PR]
    Test -->|test-required| AgentTest[🤖 Fix: Tests\nOpens Stacked PR]
    Sec -->|codeql-alert / dependency-alert| AgentSec[🤖 PR Security Fixers\nOpens Stacked PR]
    DocEval -->|docs-required| AgentDoc[🤖 Fix: Docs\nOpens Stacked PR]

    AgentLint & AgentTest & AgentSec & AgentDoc --> StackedPR[Stacked PR on Feature Branch\nTagged: lint/test/doc/security-remediation]
    StackedPR --> AutoMerge[Relay: merge stacked fixes\n.github/workflows/relay.yml\nSquash, delete branch, post audit link]
    AgentMeta --> AutoMerge
    AutoMerge -->|other repairs in flight| Recheck[Re-check only the repaired gate\nother gate results carried over]
    AutoMerge -->|last repair or review fix:\nall gates together| Pipeline

    Parallel & Recheck --> Verdict{verdict}
    Verdict -->|other repairs in flight| Wait([pending])
    Verdict -->|repaired gate still fails| Fail([❌ failure + comment])
    Verdict -->|all green, some carried| Final[One final full pipeline run] --> Pipeline
    Verdict -->|all green on this commit| Stage4[Review: request\n.github/workflows/review-request.yml]
    Stage4 --> PostSummary[Post Consolidated Summary on PR\nAudit links to all auto-merged fixes]
    Stage4 --> AICodeReview[Request GitHub Copilot Code Review\nAI architectural & semantic analysis]
    AICodeReview --> HumanReview[Developer Final Sign-Off & Review\nSingle review session for all changes]
    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge PR into Main])
